          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Modular system</span></span></p>\n<p>A variety of plate designs are available to fit your patient’s anatomy and your surgical needs. All footplates are compatible with the 1.7mm Midface screws and instrumentation.<br>\n</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Feb 07 2025 20:52:06 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
