          "jcr:created": "Thu Feb 06 2025 18:28:21 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Type II Anodization</span></span></p>\n<p>The device body and plates undergo Type II anodization, improving the surface finish. This finish may reduce the risk for tissue and bone adhesion, which can simplify the device removal.<sup>1</sup><br>\n</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Jun 02 2025 20:30:27 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      },
