          "hideComponent": "false",
          "jcr:created": "Thu Feb 06 2025 18:28:21 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">In-office removal</span></span></p>\n<p>The activation rod can be removed within the office and out-patient settings. This may potentially eliminate the need for additional operating room time and cost.<sup>2</sup><br>\n</p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Mon Jun 30 2025 19:25:42 GMT+0000",
